  "worked_solution": "The net shown corresponds to a rectangular prism. The surface area of our prism consists of $2$ squares (base and top) and $4$ rectangles (side faces). \n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Surface area} & =2\\times (\\text{Area of the base})+4\\times (\\text{Area of the side}) \\\\  & =2\\times 360+4\\times 420 \\\\  & =720+1\\,680 \\\\  & =2\\,400\\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
